                                "text": "Beneath, the distant torrent’s rushing sound\nTells where the volum’d cataract doth roll\nBetween those hanging rocks,"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5ff9d27b-0461-402f-b888-26b4dd5e0648",
                                "sense_id": "e3fa3a45-e46f-3073-b4e0-cfa99f5ca2ee",
                                "text": "While boldly to the sky\nHer ensign, wreathing high,\nInwrought with volumed smoke, and sparkling flame, she cast."
                            }
